- Remote recheck: origin/main remains 57c1f56846d221ecc55786bd3c2467ec32f11730. The candidate branch and v1.0.0-rc.5 tag are absent remotely; the exact GitHub Release endpoint returns 404.

## Required rework

Recreate the local candidate commit without a signature, preserving the exact parent, Git tree, subject, and one-commit topology. On this unpushed local branch, git commit --amend --no-gpg-sign --no-edit is the narrow repair. Then prove the new raw commit object has no gpgsig header, rerun the identity and validation gates, update the task-scoped commit evidence and review brief with the new commit SHA, and return to a fresh independent reviewer cycle. Do not push, tag, publish a release, sign, or advance downstream pins.
